  {
   "id": "math2-2015-2",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 2,
   "type": "single",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "函数 $f(x)=\\lim_{t\\to0}\\left(1+\\dfrac{\\sin t}{x}\\right)^{\\frac{x^{2}}{t}}$ 在 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$ 内（ ）",
   "options": [
    "（A）连续",
    "（B）有可去间断点",
    "（C）有跳跃间断点",
    "（D）有无穷间断点"
   ],
   "answer": "B",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "$f(x)=\\lim_{t\\to0}\\left(1+\\dfrac{\\sin t}{x}\\right)^{\\frac{x^{2}}{t}}=e^{\\lim_{t\\to0}\\frac{\\sin t}{x}\\cdot\\frac{x^{2}}{t}}=e^{x}$（$x\\neq0$），故 $f(x)$ 有可去间断点 $x=0$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "$1^\\infty$ 型：指数 = $\\lim \\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\cdot x=e^x$；$x=0$ 时底数无定义但极限 $e^0=1$ 存在 → 可去间断点（补充定义即连续）。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：先代 $x=0$ 讨论（底数无意义）——应先对固定 $x\\ne0$ 求 $t$ 极限。"
    }
   ],
   "knowledge_points": [
    "1^∞ 型极限",
    "间断点分类"
   ],
