  {
   "id": "math2-2015-3",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 3,
   "type": "single",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "设函数 $f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^{\\alpha}\\cos\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\beta}}, & x>0\\\\ 0, & x\\le 0\\end{cases}\\ (\\alpha>0,\\beta>0)$。若 $f'(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，则（ ）",
   "options": [
    "（A）$\\alpha-\\beta>1$",
    "（B）$0<\\alpha-\\beta\\le 1$",
    "（C）$\\alpha-\\beta>2$",
    "（D）$0<\\alpha-\\beta\\le 2$"
   ],
   "answer": "A",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "$x<0$ 时 $f'(x)=0$，故 $f'_-(0)=0$。$f'_+(0)=\\lim_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{x^{\\alpha}\\cos\\frac{1}{x^{\\beta}}-0}{x}=\\lim_{x\\to0^{+}}x^{\\alpha-1}\\cos\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\beta}}$。$x>0$ 时 $f'(x)=\\alpha x^{\\alpha-1}\\cos\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\beta}}+\\beta x^{\\alpha-\\beta-1}\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\beta}}$。$f'(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，则有 $f'_-(0)=f'_+(0)=\\lim_{x\\to0^{+}}x^{\\alpha-1}\\cos\\frac{1}{x^{\\beta}}=0$，得 $\\alpha-1>0$。$f'(0)=\\lim_{x\\to0^{+}}f'(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0^{+}}\\left(\\alpha x^{\\alpha-1}\\cos\\frac{1}{x^{\\beta}}+\\beta x^{\\alpha-\\beta-1}\\sin\\frac{1}{x^{\\beta}}\\right)=0$，得 $\\alpha-\\beta-1>0$，答案选择（A）。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "振荡项 $\\cos\\frac1{x^\\beta}$ 有界无极限 → 含它的项要趋于 0 必须「幂次为正」：$\\alpha-1>0$ 且 $\\alpha-\\beta-1>0$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：只检查 $f'_+(0)$ 存在而忽略 $\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f'(x)=f'(0)$（导函数连续）的第二条件。"
    }
   ],
