  {
   "id": "math2-2015-5",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 5,
   "type": "single",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "设函数 $f(u,v)$ 满足 $f\\left(x+y,\\dfrac{y}{x}\\right)=x^{2}-y^{2}$，则 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial u}\\right|_{\\substack{u=1\\\\v=1}}$ 与 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial v}\\right|_{\\substack{u=1\\\\v=1}}$ 依次是（ ）",
   "options": [
    "（A）$\\dfrac{1}{2},\\ 0$",
    "（B）$0,\\ \\dfrac{1}{2}$",
    "（C）$-\\dfrac{1}{2},\\ 0$",
    "（D）$0,\\ -\\dfrac{1}{2}$"
   ],
   "answer": "D",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "令 $u=x+y,\\ v=\\dfrac{y}{x}$，则 $x=\\dfrac{u}{1+v},\\ y=\\dfrac{uv}{1+v}$，从而 $f\\left(x+y,\\dfrac{y}{x}\\right)=x^{2}-y^{2}$ 变为 $f(u,v)=\\left(\\dfrac{u}{1+v}\\right)^{2}-\\left(\\dfrac{uv}{1+v}\\right)^{2}=\\dfrac{u^{2}(1-v)}{1+v}$。故 $\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial u}=\\dfrac{2u(1-v)}{1+v}$，$\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial v}=-\\dfrac{2u^{2}}{(1+v)^{2}}$。因而 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial u}\\right|_{\\substack{u=1\\\\v=1}}=0,\\ \\left.\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial v}\\right|_{\\substack{u=1\\\\v=1}}=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$，故选（D）。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "换元反解 $x,y$（用 $u,v$ 表示）→ 得 $f(u,v)$ 显式 → 直接求偏导代值。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：把 $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial u}$ 误当 $\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}$；先换元再求导是正路。"
    }
   ],
