   "id": "math2-2015-6",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 6,
   "type": "single",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "设 $D$ 是第一象限由曲线 $2xy=1$，$4xy=1$ 与直线 $y=x$，$y=\\sqrt{3}x$ 围成的平面区域，函数 $f(x,y)$ 在 $D$ 上连续，则 $\\iint_{D}f(x,y)dxdy=$（ ）",
   "options": [
    "（A）$\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}d\\theta\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\sin 2\\theta}}^{\\frac{1}{2\\sin 2\\theta}}f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)r\\,dr$",
    "（B）$\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}d\\theta\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\sin 2\\theta}}}^{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sin 2\\theta}}}f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)r\\,dr$",
    "（C）$\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}d\\theta\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\sin 2\\theta}}^{\\frac{1}{2\\sin 2\\theta}}f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)dr$",
    "（D）$\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}d\\theta\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\sin 2\\theta}}}^{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sin 2\\theta}}}f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)dr$"
   ],
   "answer": "B",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "根据图可得，在极坐标系下计算该二重积分的积分区域为 $D=\\left\\{(r,\\theta)\\mid \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\le\\theta\\le\\dfrac{\\pi}{3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\sin 2\\theta}}\\le r\\le\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sin 2\\theta}}\\right\\}$。所以 $\\iint_{D}f(x,y)dxdy=\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}d\\theta\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\sin 2\\theta}}}^{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sin 2\\theta}}}f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)r\\,dr$，故选（B）。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "双曲线 $2xy=1$：$r^{2}\\sin2\\theta=1$ → $r=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sin2\\theta}}$；$4xy=1$ → $r=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\sin2\\theta}}$；射线 $y=x,\\ y=\\sqrt3 x$ 给 $\\theta\\in[\\frac\\pi4,\\frac\\pi3]$；面积元 $r\\,dr\\,d\\theta$ 别丢。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：忘写雅可比 $r$（选 D 干扰项）；上下限大小（$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\sin}}<\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sin}}$）。"
    }
   ],
