   "id": "math2-2015-7",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 7,
   "type": "single",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "设矩阵 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\1&2&a\\\\1&4&a^{2}\\end{pmatrix}$，$b=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\d\\\\d^{2}\\end{pmatrix}$。若集合 $\\Omega=\\{1,2\\}$，则线性方程组 $Ax=b$ 有无穷多解的充分必要条件为（ ）",
   "options": [
    "（A）$a\\notin\\Omega,\\ d\\notin\\Omega$",
    "（B）$a\\in\\Omega,\\ d\\notin\\Omega$",
    "（C）$a\\in\\Omega,\\ d\\in\\Omega$",
    "（D）$a\\in\\Omega,\\ d\\in\\Omega$"
   ],
   "answer": "D",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "$(A,b)=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1&1\\\\1&2&a&d\\\\1&4&a^{2}&d^{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1&1\\\\0&1&a-1&d-1\\\\0&0&(a-1)(a-2)&(d-1)(d-2)\\end{pmatrix}$。由 $r(A)=r(A,b)<3$，故 $a=1$ 或 $a=2$，同时 $d=1$ 或 $d=2$，故选（D）。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "范德蒙型结构：消元后末行两个因子必须同时为零 → $a\\in\\{1,2\\}$ 且 $d\\in\\{1,2\\}$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：「无穷多解」需 $r(A)=r(\\bar A)<3$，两个条件缺一不可。"
    }
   ],
