   "stem": "$\\begin{cases}x=\\arctan t\\\\ y=3t+t^{3}\\end{cases}$ 则 $\\left.\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}\\right|_{t=1}=$ ______。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "$48$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}=\\dfrac{3+3t^{2}}{\\frac{1}{1+t^{2}}}=3(1+t^{2})^{2}$。$\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[3(1+t^{2})^{2}\\right]=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d\\left[3(1+t^{2})^{2}\\right]}{dt}}{\\dfrac{dx}{dt}}=\\dfrac{12t(1+t^{2})}{\\dfrac{1}{1+t^{2}}}=12t(1+t^{2})^{2}$。$\\left.\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}\\right|_{t=1}=48$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "参数二阶导 = (一阶导对 $t$ 的导数) ÷ $x'(t)$；$x'=\\frac{1}{1+t^2}$ 使化简很顺。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：忘记除以 $x'(t)$，直接对 $3(1+t^2)^2$ 求导当答案。"
    }
   ],
