  {
   "id": "math2-2015-10",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 10,
   "type": "fill",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "函数 $f(x)=x^{2}\\cdot 2^{x}$ 在 $x=0$ 处的 $n$ 阶导数 $f^{(n)}(0)=$ ______。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "$n(n-1)(\\ln 2)^{n-2}$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "根据莱布尼茨公式得：$f^{(n)}(0)=C_{n}^{2}2\\cdot\\left(2^{x}\\right)^{(n-2)}\\Big|_{x=0}=\\dfrac{n(n-1)}{2}\\cdot 2\\left(\\ln 2\\right)^{n-2}=n(n-1)\\left(\\ln 2\\right)^{n-2}$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "莱布尼茨：$x^2$ 的二阶以上导数为 0，只剩 $k=2$ 项：$C_n^2\\cdot 2\\cdot 2^x(\\ln2)^{n-2}|_{x=0}$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：组合数 $C_n^2=\\frac{n(n-1)}2$ 与因子 2 相消后剩 $n(n-1)$。"
    }
   ],
