   "id": "math2-2015-11",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 11,
   "type": "fill",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "设 $f(x)$ 连续，$\\varphi(x)=\\int_{0}^{x^{2}}xf(t)dt$，若 $\\varphi(1)=1,\\ \\varphi'(1)=5$，则 $f(1)=$ ______。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "$2$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "已知 $\\varphi(x)=x\\int_{0}^{x^{2}}f(t)dt$，求导得 $\\varphi'(x)=\\int_{0}^{x^{2}}f(t)dt+2x^{2}f(x^{2})$，故有 $\\varphi(1)=\\int_{0}^{1}f(t)dt=1$，$\\varphi'(1)=1+2f(1)=5$，则 $f(1)=2$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "乘积 + 变限（上限 $x^2$）求导：$\\varphi'=\\int_0^{x^2}f\\,dt+x\\cdot f(x^2)\\cdot 2x$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：$x$ 也在被积函数里——必须先提出再求导（不能直接套变限公式）。"
    }
   ],
