  {
   "id": "math2-2015-13",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 13,
   "type": "fill",
   "score": 4,
   "stem": "若函数 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $e^{x+2y+3z}+xyz=1$ 确定，则 $dz\\big|_{(0,0)}=$ ______。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "$-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\left(dx+2dy\\right)$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "当 $x=0,\\ y=0$ 时可得 $z=0$。则对该式两边求偏导可得 $\\left(3e^{x+2y+3z}+xy\\right)\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=-yz-e^{x+2y+3z}$，$\\left(3e^{x+2y+3z}+xy\\right)\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=-xz-2e^{x+2y+3z}$。将 $(0,0,0)$ 点值代入即有 $\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(0,0)}=-\\dfrac{1}{3}$，$\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\right|_{(0,0)}=-\\dfrac{2}{3}$。则可得 $dz|_{(0,0)}=-\\dfrac{1}{3}dx-\\dfrac{2}{3}dy=-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\left(dx+2dy\\right)$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "先代点得 $z=0$，再隐函数求偏导；$e^0=1$ 代入系数 $3$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：$e^{x+2y+3z}$ 对 $y$ 求导的因子 2。"
    }
   ],
