  {
   "id": "math2-2015-16",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 16,
   "type": "essay",
   "score": 10,
   "stem": "（本题满分 10 分）设 $A>0$，$D$ 是由曲线段 $y=A\\sin x\\ (0\\le x\\le\\dfrac{\\pi}{2})$ 及直线 $y=0$，$x=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$ 所围成的平面区域，$V_{1},V_{2}$ 分别表示 $D$ 绕 $x$ 轴与绕 $y$ 轴旋转成旋转体的体积。若 $V_{1}=V_{2}$，求 $A$ 的值。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "$A=\\dfrac{8}{\\pi}$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "由旋转体的体积公式，得 $V_{1}=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\pi f^{2}(x)dx=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\pi\\left(A\\sin x\\right)^{2}dx=\\pi A^{2}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\dfrac{1-\\cos 2x}{2}dx=\\dfrac{\\pi^{2}A^{2}}{4}$。$V_{2}=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}2\\pi x f(x)dx=2\\pi A\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}x\\,d\\cos x=2\\pi A$。由题 $V_{1}=V_{2}$，求得 $A=\\dfrac{8}{\\pi}$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "绕 $x$ 轴圆盘法（$\\sin^2$ 降幂）；绕 $y$ 轴柱壳法 $2\\pi\\int x\\cdot A\\sin x\\,dx$（分部积分）；两者相等解 $A$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：柱壳法公式 $2\\pi\\int x\\,f(x)dx$（$A$ 提出后与 $\\pi^2A^2/4$ 量纲匹配）。"
    }
   ],
