  {
   "id": "math2-2015-17",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 17,
   "type": "essay",
   "score": 11,
   "stem": "（本题满分 11 分）已知函数 $f(x,y)$ 满足 $f''_{xy}(x,y)=2(y+1)e^{x}$，$f'_{x}(x,0)=(x+1)e^{x}$，$f(0,y)=y^{2}+2y$，求 $f(x,y)$ 的极值。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "极小值 $f(0,-1)=-1$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "$f''_{xy}(x,y)=2(y+1)e^{x}$ 两边对 $y$ 积分，得 $f'_{x}(x,y)=2\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}y^{2}+y\\right)e^{x}+\\varphi(x)=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+\\varphi(x)$。故 $f'_{x}(x,0)=\\varphi(x)=(x+1)e^{x}$。求得 $\\varphi(x)=e^{x}(x+1)$，故 $f'_{x}(x,y)=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+e^{x}(1+x)$。两边关于 $x$ 积分，得 $f(x,y)=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+\\int e^{x}(1+x)dx=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+(1+x)e^{x}-\\int e^{x}dx=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+xe^{x}+C$。由 $f(0,y)=y^{2}+2y+C=y^{2}+2y$，求得 $C=0$。所以 $f(x,y)=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+xe^{x}$。令 $\\begin{cases}f'_{x}=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+e^{x}+xe^{x}=0\\\\ f'_{y}=(2y+2)e^{x}=0\\end{cases}$，求得 $\\begin{cases}x=0\\\\y=-1\\end{cases}$。又 $f''_{xx}=(y^{2}+2y)e^{x}+2e^{x}+xe^{x}$，$f''_{xy}=2(y+1)e^{x}$，$f''_{yy}=2e^{x}$。当 $x=0,\\ y=-1$ 时，$A=f''_{xx}(0,-1)=1$，$B=f''_{xy}(0,-1)=0$，$C=f''_{yy}(0,-1)=2$，$AC-B^{2}>0$，$f(0,-1)=-1$ 为极小值。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "两次偏积分恢复 $f$（每步用边界条件定待定函数）；驻点 $(0,-1)$；$AC-B^2=2>0,\\ A=1>0$ → 极小值 −1。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：偏积分的「待定函数」$\\varphi(x)$ 两步都出现；$f(0,y)$ 条件在最后用。"
    }
   ],
