  {
   "id": "math2-2015-18",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 18,
   "type": "essay",
   "score": 10,
   "stem": "（本题满分 10 分）计算二重积分 $\\iint_{D}x(x+y)dxdy$，其中 $D=\\left\\{(x,y)\\mid x^{2}+y^{2}\\le2,\\ y\\ge x^{2}\\right\\}$。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}-\\dfrac{2}{5}$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "由于被积区域关于 $y$ 轴对称且 $xy$ 是关于 $x$ 的奇函数，则 $\\iint_{D}xy\\,dxdy=0$。故 $\\iint_{D}x(x+y)dxdy=\\iint_{D}x^{2}dxdy=2\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{x^{2}}^{\\sqrt{2-x^{2}}}x^{2}dy=2\\int_{0}^{1}x^{2}\\left(\\sqrt{2-x^{2}}-x^{2}\\right)dx$。$=2\\int_{0}^{1}x^{2}\\sqrt{2-x^{2}}dx-\\dfrac{2}{5}=2\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}4\\sin^{2}t\\cdot 2\\cos^{2}t\\,dt-\\dfrac{2}{5}=2\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\sin^{2}2t\\,dt-\\dfrac{2}{5}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}-\\dfrac{2}{5}$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "对称性砍掉 $xy$ 项；剩下的 $\\iint x^2$ 用直角坐标（区域由圆与抛物线围成），$x$ 换元 $x=\\sqrt2\\sin t$ 化三角积分。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：换元上下限 $x:0\\to1$ 对应 $t:0\\to\\pi/4$；$\\int\\sin^2 2t\\,dt$ 降幂。"
    }
   ],
