  {
   "id": "math2-2015-22",
   "subject": "math2",
   "year": 2015,
   "num": 22,
   "type": "essay",
   "score": 11,
   "stem": "（本题满分 11 分）设矩阵 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}a&1&0\\\\1&a&-1\\\\0&1&a\\end{pmatrix}$，且 $A^{3}=O$。（I）求 $a$ 的值；（II）若矩阵 $X$ 满足 $X-XA^{2}-AX+AXA^{2}=E$，$E$ 为 3 阶单位阵，求 $X$。",
   "options": [],
   "answer": "（I）$a=0$；（II）$X=\\begin{pmatrix}3&1&-2\\\\1&1&-1\\\\2&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$",
   "source_blocks": [
    {
     "role": "analysis",
     "origin": "source",
     "text": "(I) $A^{3}=O\\Rightarrow|A|=0\\Rightarrow\\begin{vmatrix}a&1&0\\\\1&a&-1\\\\0&1&a\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}0&1&0\\\\1-a^{2}&a&-1\\\\-a&1&a\\end{vmatrix}=a^{3}=0\\Rightarrow a=0$。(II) 由题意知 $X-XA^{2}-AX+AXA^{2}=E\\Rightarrow X\\left(E-A^{2}\\right)-AX\\left(E-A^{2}\\right)=E\\Rightarrow(E-A)X\\left(E-A^{2}\\right)=E\\Rightarrow X=\\left(E-A\\right)^{-1}\\left(E-A^{2}\\right)^{-1}=\\left[\\left(E-A^{2}\\right)(E-A)\\right]^{-1}\\Rightarrow X=\\left(E-A^{2}-A\\right)^{-1}$。且 $A^{3}=O$，$E-A^{2}-A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&1\\\\-1&1&1\\\\-1&-1&2\\end{pmatrix}$。对 $(E-A^{2}-A:E)$ 作初等行变换 $\\to\\cdots\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0&:3&1&-2\\\\0&1&0&:1&1&-1\\\\0&0&1&:2&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\therefore X=\\begin{pmatrix}3&1&-2\\\\1&1&-1\\\\2&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$。"
    },
    {
     "role": "approach",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "(I) $|A|=0$（幂零矩阵行列式为 0）；(II) 因式分解 $X(E-A^2)-AX(E-A^2)=E$ → $(E-A)X(E-A^2)=E$ → $X=[(E-A^2)(E-A)]^{-1}$，注意顺序。"
    },
    {
     "role": "warn",
     "origin": "extended",
     "text": "易错：因式分解提公因子的方向（左提出 $(E-A)$ 需验证可交换性——此处按块因式分解严格成立）；求逆时 $(E-A^2)(E-A)=E-A^2-A+A^3=E-A^2-A$。"
    }
   ],
